## 4. Overview

Must contain:

- product/project name
- one concise paragraph describing BankCRM
- purpose of the project
- actual technology stack

Describe BankCRM as a **simple banking CRM practice/portfolio
project**, not as a production banking system.

The purpose is to demonstrate an end-to-end, AI-assisted software
development lifecycle combining product/business analysis, software
development, QA and test automation, data/database work, CI/CD,
security, and AI-assisted engineering.

Derive the stack from `package.json`, `docs/architecture/`, accepted
ADRs, and AUTH/architecture documentation. Do not name libraries that
are not actually used.

Current accepted architectural decisions (link the files that exist):

- Vite + React + TypeScript — ADR-0002
- Supabase Auth + PostgreSQL + RLS — AUTH-001

Do not include release status or current implementation status.

