Link `docs/sdlc/lifecycle.md` (canonical SDLC). There is no
`docs/sdlc/README.md` unless it is actually created later.

Summarize:

```
Requirement
    ↓
Specification
    ↓
DoR
    ↓
Implementation Plan
    ↓
Human approval → PLANNED
    ↓
Implementation
    ↓
Tests
    ↓
PR → test
    ↓
QA
    ↓
Human merge → main
    ↓
Production verification
```

Explain: specify before implement; DoR is a human gate; plan must be
approved; implement after `PLANNED`; PRs target `test`; QA on `test`;
